    "link_length_measured_m is cached during cooperative transport. It remains constant and is not evidence of constant physical cable geometry.",
    "Prehandoff samples deduplicate consecutive identical three-cable cached geometry vectors. Raw payload sample timestamps are not logged, so exact independent sensor-frame counts cannot be recovered.",
